IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wla-offences`

-- Wildlife Act 1965, ss 2, 5A to 5C, 6 to 9, 12, 12C, 12E, 12K and other offence maxima -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wildlife-act-1965.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`feeding monkeys without approval` MEANS Conduct WITH
    `activity` IS `feeding`
    `the animal is wildlife` IS TRUE
    `the person acted intentionally` IS TRUE
    `the wildlife is alive` IS TRUE
    `has the Director-General's written approval` IS FALSE
    `breached a condition of the approval` IS FALSE
    `is the occupier or person in charge of the land` IS FALSE
    `the wildlife was found damaging crops or property on the land` IS FALSE
    `the wildlife is protected` IS FALSE
    `in the course of an animal-related business` IS FALSE
    `is a second or subsequent conviction` IS FALSE

